# Mobs that cast in a fight, run with @spec as mobile_update would, at the entrance to Mud School (3700), with only
# area_update running. Each mob starts a fight with Heroic (51, 30000 hit points); Smokegod (60) breaks it up,
# fetches Heroic back from wherever a teleport sent him, restores him and purges the room between fights.
# - an elven wizard (cast_mage, 18), a captain (cast_mage, 27: teleport, plague and acid blast too)
# - Gargamel (cast_cleric, 10) and Zeus (cast_cleric, 60, the whole list)
# - a spectre (cast_undead, 19), a rookie judge (cast_judge, 20)
# - the darkenbeast (poison, 24): a bite half the time
# - each of them, not fighting, does nothing
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
goto 3700
holylight
@connect hero
Heroic
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
transfer heroic 3700
set char heroic hp 30000
restore heroic
@mob 1100 3700
@spec
force wizard kill heroic
@spec 8
peace
transfer heroic 3700
restore heroic
purge
@pulse 12
